        <ExplanationTxt>THE VOLUNTEERS PERFORM PRIVATE SOLICITATIONS SOUGHT FROM THE LAMBDA CHI ALPHA COMMUNITY OF APPROXIMATELY 300,000 MEMBERS AND BY THOSE 300,000 MEMBERS FROM THEIR FRIENDS, COLLEAGUES AND CONTACTS IN THEIR COMMUNITIES. THE ACTIVITY OF THE CORPORATION WILL BE PRIMARILY CONDUCTED BY THOSE VOLUNTEERS, HOWEVER, CARRYING OUT THE CHARITABLE AND EDUCATIONAL PURPOSES FOR WHICH THE RESOURCES OF THE CORPORATION WILL BE USED WILL BE A PARTNERSHIP BETWEEN THE VOLUNTEER COMING TO THE CORPORATION WITH THE IDENTIFIED CHARITABLE OR EDUCATIONAL NEED FROM THEIR COMMUNITY. THE CORPORATION WILL PROVIDE THE RESOURCES AND INFRASTRUCTURE, AND THE VOLUNTEER WILL BE THE "BOOTS ON THE GROUND" TO ACTUALLY PROVIDE THE CHARITABLE SERVICES IN THEIR COMMUNITY.</ExplanationTxt>
