      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PAGE 6, PART VI, LINE 19</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>COPY OF ALL RECORDS ARE MAINTAINED AT THE OFFICE OF THE ORGANIZATION. RECORDS ARE ALSO PROVIDED TO THE CALIFORNIA ATTORNEY GENERAL'S REGISTRY OF CHARITABLE TRUSTS WITH TAX AND REQUIRED LEGAL DOCUMENTS FILED THERE ON AN ANNUAL BASIS. THE REGISTRY POSTS THESE DOCUMENTS ON THEIR GOVERNMENT WEBSITE AND IS AVAILABLE IN DOWNLOADABLE FORMAT.</ExplanationTxt>
